Tutorial Guy, added in '''Beta 30.0''', had the ability to add 1 random [https://undercards.fandom.com/wiki/Category:Basic Basic] card to your hand, which got introduced in the very same update, and get its cost reduced by 1. In '''Beta 38.2''', this was buffed to letting you choose 1 out of 3.

=== Stats ===
ATK: 3

HP: 3

Cost: 4

Abilities:
* Magic: Add a random Basic card to your hand with -1 cost. (Post Beta 30.0)
* Magic: See 3 random Basic cards. Choose 1. Add it to your hand with -1 cost. (Post Beta 38.2, Current)
Rarity: Blue (Rare)
